error[TYP005]: binary `<` requires operands of the same numeric type
 --> tests/golden/compile_fail/integer_operation_types.ska:2:14
   |
2 |     return 1 < 2u;
   |              ^ operator cannot be applied to these operand types
   |
2 |     return 1 < 2u;
   |            - left operand has type `i64`
   |
2 |     return 1 < 2u;
   |                -- right operand has type `u64`
  = note: numeric operand types are `i64`, `u64`, `u8`, or `f64`

error[TYP005]: primitive cast requires a primitive value source
 --> tests/golden/compile_fail/integer_operation_types.ska:10:18
    |
10 |     return (u64) value;
    |                  ^^^^^ source has type `array a0`
    |
10 |     return (u64) value;
    |             --- primitive cast target
  = note: primitive value types are `i64`, `u64`, `u8`, `f64`, or `bool`

